<title>FRANCE: France to sell 16 to 18 bln Ffr of OATs Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 16 to 18 bln Ffr of OATs Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to offer between 16 and 18 billion francs of government bonds (OATs) at its next scheduled auction on November 7, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Treasury will offer the current 10-year benchmark OAT, the 6.50 percent October 2006 OAT, with a payment date of November 25, the statement said.</p>
<p>The Treasury also said it would offer the 8.25 percent February 2004 OAT and the TEC 10 variable rate OAT which matures in October 2006, both with a payment date of November 25.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
